{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n<img alt=\"時事全方位重點提要｜11月12日\" src=\"https://news.now.com/nownews/NewsImage/MAG-PROMO-261112.jpg\"><p>【Now新聞台】政府計劃明年1月起實施政府僱員照顧家庭假，每名僱員每年最多有12小時，可以短暫離開工作崗位照顧家庭需要，工會有何意見？私人市場又會否跟隨？</p><p>周四的《時事全方位》，請來嘉賓討論。</p><p>題目：僕照顧家庭假</p><p>熱線電話：1833298</p></body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-11T11:37:16.464184+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":119,"images":1,"source":"Now 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-11T10:47:25+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-11T21:38:26.087476+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-11T11:30:53.025510+00:00","content_hash":"4e1730b6a32f7796cfbafcd965fb673d65bb79374eb4d07e184b5e004a0b7438","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}